# Concordia: eukaryotic genome structural + functional annotation workflow
# Documentation: README.md, docs/deployment_guide.md
#
#   cd <analysis dir>   (results are written to Snakemake's working directory, -d)
#   snakemake -s <code dir>/workflow/Snakefile -d . --configfile config.yaml --profile <code dir>/profiles/local -n
#
# Results are written to <outdir>/00_Data ... 07_Report. Every rule first writes its full command
# to <step>/scripts/<NN>_<rule>[.<wildcard>].sh and then runs that script (see workflow/lib/shell_script.py).

